---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import DesktopPreview from '../components/DesktopPreview.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const to = (relative) => `${base}${relative}`;
---
<SiteLayout page="home" title="FlameWM — Your desktop, distilled." description="An independent Rust desktop and window manager for Linux. Familiar to use, thoughtful by design, and lightweight at heart.">
  <section class="hero hero-grid" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-copy" data-reveal>
      <a class="hero-announcement" href={to('about/')}><span class="announcement-dot"></span> Introducing a new kind of Linux desktop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <h1 id="hero-heading">Your desktop.<br /><span>Distilled.</span></h1>
      <p>All the familiarity you expect. None of the excess you don’t. Meet FlameWM, a beautifully considered desktop built for the way you work.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-accent" href={to('try/')}>Experience the demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/ArkFlame/flamewm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="hero-note"><span class="mini-led"></span> Independent Rust project · In active development</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual container" data-reveal>
      <div class="hero-screen-frame"><div class="screen-bezel"><DesktopPreview /></div><div class="screen-caption"><span>FLAMEWM / INTERFACE CONCEPT</span><span>01 — THE DESKTOP</span></div></div>
      <p class="image-disclaimer">Illustrative UI preview. Final product screenshots will replace the concept imagery.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="statement-strip" aria-label="FlameWM principles"><div class="container statement-inner"><div><span class="statement-marker">01 /</span><strong>Intuitive by default.</strong></div><div><span class="statement-marker">02 /</span><strong>Purposefully lightweight.</strong></div><div><span class="statement-marker">03 /</span><strong>Yours to make.</strong></div></div></section>
  <section class="light-section intro-section" id="experience"><div class="container">
    <div class="split-heading" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow red">THE EXPERIENCE</span><h2>It just feels<br /><em>right.</em></h2></div><div><p>A desktop should help you get things done, not give you another system to manage. FlameWM brings the essentials together in an interface that feels natural from the first click.</p><a class="text-link" href={to('features/')}>Discover the experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <article class="editorial-card editor-card-one" data-reveal><div class="editorial-art editorial-task"><div class="wallpaper-art"><div class="task-demo-top">Workspace / 01 <span>10:42</span></div><div class="task-demo-dock"><span class="dock-accent">◈</span><span>▤</span><span>◉</span><span>▣</span><span>✦</span><i></i><small>⌁ &nbsp; ◕ &nbsp; 10:42</small></div></div></div><div class="editorial-body"><div class="card-index">01 &nbsp; / &nbsp; MADE FAMILIAR</div><h3>Everything in its place.</h3><p>One coherent home for your apps, windows, workspaces and everyday controls.</p></div></article>
      <article class="editorial-card editor-card-two" data-reveal><div class="editorial-art editorial-window"><div class="mock-glass-card"><div class="window-graphic-top">YOUR WORKSPACE <span>×</span></div><div class="window-grid"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div><div class="window-divider"></div><div class="fake-text-lg"></div><div class="fake-text-sm"></div></div><div class="float-dot">↗</div></div><div class="editorial-body"><div class="card-index">02 &nbsp; / &nbsp; STAY IN FLOW</div><h3>Windows, effortlessly.</h3><p>Thoughtful snapping, straightforward multitasking and spaces for every part of your day.</p></div></article>
      <article class="editorial-card editor-card-three" data-reveal><div class="editorial-art editorial-color"><div class="palette-window"><span class="palette-label">Make it yours</span><h4>Choose your accent.</h4><div class="palette-circle-row"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="palette-preview">Appearance <b>● &nbsp; Dark</b></div></div></div><div class="editorial-body"><div class="card-index">03 &nbsp; / &nbsp; PERSONAL BY NATURE</div><h3>Simply yours.</h3><p>Change what matters. Keep the experience consistent, calm and unmistakably FlameWM.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="dark-section feature-story" id="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-title-center" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFUL BY DESIGN</span><h2>Less to think about.<br /><span>More room to create.</span></h2><p>Every detail has a job to do. Nothing needs to shout.</p></div>
    <div class="story-grid"><div class="story-large" data-reveal><div class="story-visual"><div class="story-window-ambient"></div><div class="story-setting-pane"><div class="story-menu"><span class="story-menu-header">FLAMEWM</span><span class="story-menu-item">◉ &nbsp; Appearance</span><span>▱ &nbsp; Desktop</span><span>▤ &nbsp; Taskbar</span><span>▣ &nbsp; Displays</span><span>⌨ &nbsp; Shortcuts</span></div><div class="story-setting-main"><small>APPEARANCE</small><h4>Make yourself<br />at home.</h4><div class="story-appearance"><div></div><div></div></div><span class="story-small-line"></span><span class="story-small-line short"></span></div></div></div><div class="story-card-caption"><span class="card-index light-index">CONTROL WITHOUT COMPLEXITY</span><h3>Settings that make sense.</h3><p>Clear choices for appearance, displays, shortcuts and the desktop. No configuration expertise required.</p></div></div>
      <div class="story-right"><div class="story-small story-performance" data-reveal><div class="abstract-speed" aria-hidden="true"><div class="speed-ring"></div><span>LESS<br />OVERHEAD</span></div><div><span class="card-index light-index">BUILT IN RUST</span><h3>Lean at heart.</h3><p>An independent native desktop, designed to respect your system resources.</p></div></div><div class="story-small story-open" data-reveal><div class="open-symbol">&#123;<span>/</span>&#125;</div><div><span class="card-index light-index">OPEN DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Made in the open.</h3><p>Explore the source, follow development and help shape what comes next.</p></div></div></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="light-section philosophy" id="philosophy"><div class="container philosophy-grid"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow red">OUR APPROACH</span><h2>Familiar.<br />Fast.<br /><span>Finished.</span></h2></div><div class="philosophy-content" data-reveal><p class="philosophy-lead">You shouldn’t need to choose between a desktop that feels complete and one that stays out of your way.</p><div class="philosophy-line"><span>01</span><div><h3>The essentials, thoughtfully done.</h3><p>A coherent desktop, taskbar, launcher and controls from the start.</p></div></div><div class="philosophy-line"><span>02</span><div><h3>Quiet in the background.</h3><p>Efficiency is part of the design, not a feature hidden behind settings.</p></div></div><div class="philosophy-line"><span>03</span><div><h3>Built to feel like your own.</h3><p>Meaningful personalization without endless decisions or unnecessary complexity.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="preview-section"><div class="container preview-layout"><div class="preview-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow red">HANDS-ON PREVIEW</span><h2>See where we’re headed.</h2><p>Explore our interactive desktop prototype. Open the launcher, move windows and discover the design direction before final screenshots are available.</p><div class="preview-actions"><a href={to('try/')} class="button button-dark">Launch interactive demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>Runs in your browser · UI prototype only</span></div></div><div class="preview-image" data-reveal><img src={to('assets/images/flamewm-settings.webp')} alt="FlameWM System Settings development reference screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="755" height="505" /><span class="preview-image-caption">REFERENCE SCREENSHOT · DEVELOPMENT BUILD</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="last-cta"><div class="container last-cta-inner" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">THIS IS JUST THE BEGINNING</span><h2>A lighter desktop<br />starts here.</h2><p>FlameWM is being built in the open. See the code, try the concept, and follow the journey.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-accent" href="https://github.com/ArkFlame/flamewm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="https://paypal.me/LinsaFTW" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Support development <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
